1
00:00:03,233 --> 00:00:07,324
The phone is the round button at the bottom right of an admin page.

2
00:00:07,324 --> 00:00:09,453
Click it to open the soft phone.

3
00:00:09,958 --> 00:00:15,105
The Keypad dials a number, and the other tabs list recent calls and voicemail.

4
00:00:15,105 --> 00:00:18,598
Its status shows Ready when the provider is set up.

5
00:00:20,887 --> 00:00:26,241
With the diagnostics tab turned on, a Diagnostics tab shows live media statistics,

6
00:00:26,241 --> 00:00:31,048
a microphone level meter, provider warnings and an audio test, so a sound

7
00:00:31,048 --> 00:00:32,691
problem can be found.

8
00:00:32,691 --> 00:00:35,794
Turn it on to troubleshoot, then turn it off.

9
00:00:35,794 --> 00:00:39,627
This site has no real provider, so a call cannot connect.

